      "year": 1434,
      "title": "Jan van Eyck paints the Arnolfini Portrait",
      "titleZh": "扬·范艾克绘制《阿尔诺芬尼夫妇像》",
      "summary": "The Arnolfini Portrait made oil painting a vehicle for domestic space, material detail, social status, and visual ambiguity.",
