      "titleZh": "列奥纳多完成《最后的晚餐》",
      "summary": "Leonardo's Last Supper turned a monastic dining wall into a psychological and spatial drama of recognition, betrayal, and sacred presence.",
      "summaryZh": "列奥纳多的《最后的晚餐》把修道院餐厅墙面变成关于认知、背叛与神圣临场的心理和空间戏剧。",
      "eventIntro": "By 1498, Leonardo da Vinci had completed The Last Supper for Santa Maria delle Grazie in Milan. The composition organizes the apostles' reactions around Christ with architectural perspective, controlled gesture, and a charged narrative instant.",
