      "whyMatters": "The work became one of the clearest demonstrations of Renaissance painting as a system for arranging bodies, space, emotion, theology, and viewer attention.",
      "whyMattersZh": "这件作品成为文艺复兴绘画最清楚的示范之一：绘画可以成为组织身体、空间、情感、神学和观者注意力的系统。",
      "phaseRelation": "It belongs to Renaissance perspective and oil painting because it makes spatial construction and human psychology central to devotional image-making.",
      "phaseRelationZh": "它属于“文艺复兴透视与油画”阶段，因为它把空间建构和人的心理反应放到宗教图像制作的中心。",
