      "year": 1511,
      "title": "Raphael completes The School of Athens",
      "titleZh": "拉斐尔完成《雅典学院》",
      "summary": "Raphael's fresco staged classical philosophy as a Renaissance architecture of knowledge, perspective, and humanist memory.",
      "summaryZh": "拉斐尔的壁画把古典哲学表现为由知识、透视和人文主义记忆构成的文艺复兴建筑。",
      "eventIntro": "Around 1511, Raphael completed The School of Athens in the Vatican Stanze. The fresco imagines ancient philosophers gathered inside an ideal architectural space, turning learning itself into a visual order.",
      "eventIntroZh": "约 1511 年，拉斐尔在梵蒂冈签字厅完成《雅典学院》。这幅壁画想象古代哲学家聚集在理想建筑空间中，把学习本身转化为视觉秩序。",
      "whyMatters": "The painting became a canonical expression of High Renaissance humanism: classical antiquity, mathematical space, papal patronage, and artistic self-consciousness all meet in one image.",
      "whyMattersZh": "这幅画成为盛期文艺复兴人文主义的经典表达：古典传统、数学空间、教皇赞助和艺术自觉在同一图像中汇合。",
      "phaseRelation": "It belongs to Renaissance perspective and oil painting because it shows perspective not as a trick, but as a worldview for organizing knowledge and authority.",
      "phaseRelationZh": "它属于“文艺复兴透视与油画”阶段，因为它显示透视并非单纯技巧，而是组织知识和权威的世界观。",
      "connectionHint": "It connects art to philosophy, education, church power, and the later museum idea of Renaissance art as a high point of European culture.",
