      "eventIntro": "In 1862, photographs of the dead at Antietam, taken by Alexander Gardner and associated with Mathew Brady's gallery, were exhibited in New York. Viewers encountered war through photographic evidence rather than heroic painting alone.",
      "eventIntroZh": "1862 年，亚历山大·加德纳拍摄、与马修·布雷迪画廊相关的安提坦阵亡者照片在纽约展出。观众不再只通过英雄化绘画理解战争，而是面对摄影证据。",
