      "titleZh": "柯达 DCS 100 数码相机系统发布",
      "summary": "The Kodak DCS 100 made professional digital photography commercially available, linking cameras, sensors, storage, and computer workflows.",
      "summaryZh": "柯达 DCS 100 让专业数码摄影进入商业可用阶段，把相机、传感器、存储和计算机流程连接起来。",
