      "eventIntroZh": "1991 年，柯达发布 DCS 100 专业数码相机系统，基于改装尼康机身和外置存储单元。它昂贵且专门化，但让数码捕捉成为真实工作工具。",
      "whyMatters": "The DCS 100 mattered because it moved photography toward sensor data, files, storage, and software. It foreshadowed the digital workflow that would later transform journalism, archives, editing, and everyday image culture.",
      "whyMattersZh": "DCS 100 重要，因为它把摄影推向传感器数据、文件、存储和软件。它预示了后来改变新闻、档案、编辑和日常图像文化的数字流程。",
      "phaseRelation": "It belongs to Digital photography and networked images because it marks the professional transition from chemical film to digital capture.",
      "phaseRelationZh": "它属于“数字摄影与网络图像”阶段，因为它标志专业摄影从化学胶片转向数字捕捉。",
      "connectionHint": "It connects to CCD sensors, Photoshop, newsroom digitization, databases, and the later smartphone camera ecosystem.",
      "connectionHintZh": "它连接到 CCD 传感器、Photoshop、新闻编辑部数字化、数据库，以及后来的智能手机相机生态。",
