      "titleZh": "Google AdWords 推出",
      "summary": "Google launched AdWords in 2000, helping turn search into an auction-based advertising business and a central platform economy model.",
      "summaryZh": "Google 于 2000 年推出 AdWords，推动搜索变成基于竞价的广告业务，并成为平台经济的核心模式。",
      "eventIntro": "Google introduced AdWords as a self-service advertising system that let businesses buy keyword-linked placement. Search advertising turned user intent into a measurable market rather than treating web pages only as display surfaces.",
