      "titleZh": "AOL 与时代华纳宣布合并",
      "summary": "The announced AOL-Time Warner merger symbolized the ambition to fuse internet access, media libraries, cable systems, advertising, and entertainment into one conglomerate.",
      "summaryZh": "AOL 与时代华纳宣布合并，象征着把互联网接入、媒体内容、有线系统、广告和娱乐整合为同一巨型集团的雄心。",
