      "summaryZh": "《花样年华》把记忆、城市亲密关系、服装、音乐和克制表演凝聚成 2000 年前后全球艺术电影的代表作品之一。",
      "eventIntro": "Wong Kar-wai's In the Mood for Love premiered in 2000. Its stylized treatment of 1960s Hong Kong, missed intimacy, repetition, and visual rhythm became internationally influential.",
      "eventIntroZh": "王家卫的《花样年华》于 2000 年首映。它对 1960 年代香港、错失的亲密、重复和视觉节奏的风格化处理产生了国际影响。",
      "whyMatters": "The film matters because it shows cinema as atmosphere, memory, and form rather than only plot. It became a touchstone for costume, music, cinematography, and transnational cinephile culture.",
      "whyMattersZh": "这部电影的重要性在于它把电影呈现为空气感、记忆和形式，而不只是情节。它成为服装、音乐、摄影和跨国影迷文化的参照。",
      "phaseRelation": "This event belongs to the late twentieth-century global cinema phase because festival circuits, art-house distribution, and home video helped films travel as style and mood.",
      "phaseRelationZh": "它属于二十世纪末全球电影阶段，因为电影节、艺术院线和家庭录像帮助电影以风格和氛围的方式流通。",
